{"sequence": 32, "time_s": 3.783207, "type": "evidence", "evidence": {"evidence_id": "d9s0", "title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "url": "https://trace.invalid/hotpotqa_5ae3f4fe5542995ad6573ce8_immediate/d9s0", "text": "Gordonia lasianthus (loblolly-bay, holly-bay, gordonia, or bay) is a small to medium-sized evergreen tree or shrub found in acid, swampy soils of pinelands and bays on the Atlantic and Gulf Coastal Plains of the southeastern United States.", "visible_time_s": 3.783203399994818, "requested_subject": "", "resolved_title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "entity_resolution": "unspecified"}}
{"sequence": 33, "time_s": 3.783228, "type": "evidence", "evidence": {"evidence_id": "d9s1", "title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "url": "https://trace.invalid/hotpotqa_5ae3f4fe5542995ad6573ce8_immediate/d9s1", "text": "It is a member of the Tea or Theaceae family.", "visible_time_s": 3.7832243999946513, "requested_subject": "", "resolved_title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "entity_resolution": "unspecified"}}
{"sequence": 34, "time_s": 3.783248, "type": "evidence", "evidence": {"evidence_id": "d9s2", "title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "url": "https://trace.invalid/hotpotqa_5ae3f4fe5542995ad6573ce8_immediate/d9s2", "text": "It is slow growing with soft, light-colored(Varies in color from Cream to Carmine), fine-grained wood of little commercial value, although loblolly-bay could be managed as a source of pulpwood.", "visible_time_s": 3.7832443000006606, "requested_subject": "", "resolved_title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "entity_resolution": "unspecified"}}
{"sequence": 35, "time_s": 3.783268, "type": "evidence", "evidence": {"evidence_id": "d9s3", "title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "url": "https://trace.invalid/hotpotqa_5ae3f4fe5542995ad6573ce8_immediate/d9s3", "text": "When older specimens are cut, the wood exudes a strong scent.", "visible_time_s": 3.7832644999944023, "requested_subject": "", "resolved_title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "entity_resolution": "unspecified"}}
{"sequence": 36, "time_s": 3.783288, "type": "evidence", "evidence": {"evidence_id": "d9s4", "title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "url": "https://trace.invalid/hotpotqa_5ae3f4fe5542995ad6573ce8_immediate/d9s4", "text": "It is similar to a mixture of fresh oranges and pine sap.", "visible_time_s": 3.78328469999542, "requested_subject": "", "resolved_title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "entity_resolution": "unspecified"}}
{"sequence": 37, "time_s": 3.783322, "type": "evidence", "evidence": {"evidence_id": "d9s5", "title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "url": "https://trace.invalid/hotpotqa_5ae3f4fe5542995ad6573ce8_immediate/d9s5", "text": "The bark of the adult tree varies from medium grey to a red brown coloration.", "visible_time_s": 3.783317800000077, "requested_subject": "", "resolved_title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "entity_resolution": "unspecified"}}
{"sequence": 38, "time_s": 3.783342, "type": "evidence", "evidence": {"evidence_id": "d9s6", "title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "url": "https://trace.invalid/hotpotqa_5ae3f4fe5542995ad6573ce8_immediate/d9s6", "text": "Dead adult specimens of loblolly bay exhibit a lustorous shine when exposed to sunlight for several years.", "visible_time_s": 3.783338499997626, "requested_subject": "", "resolved_title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "entity_resolution": "unspecified"}}
{"sequence": 39, "time_s": 3.783372, "type": "evidence", "evidence": {"evidence_id": "d9s7", "title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "url": "https://trace.invalid/hotpotqa_5ae3f4fe5542995ad6573ce8_immediate/d9s7", "text": "The white showy flowers and shiny foliage make it a desirable ornamental, but it is not easy to cultivate.", "visible_time_s": 3.7833592999959365, "requested_subject": "", "resolved_title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "entity_resolution": "unspecified"}}
{"sequence": 40, "time_s": 3.783394, "type": "evidence", "evidence": {"evidence_id": "d9s8", "title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "url": "https://trace.invalid/hotpotqa_5ae3f4fe5542995ad6573ce8_immediate/d9s8", "text": "Deer browse stump sprouts heavily.", "visible_time_s": 3.7833896999945864, "requested_subject": "", "resolved_title": "Gordonia lasianthus", "entity_resolution": "unspecified"}}
